517	    /**
518	     * Rejects an owner payload that is missing or blank in any required field. Bean Validation
519	     * already rejects {@code null} values and some formats, but a whitespace-only value can still
520	     * satisfy a {@code @Size(min = 1)} constraint; this guard catches those remaining cases.
521	     *
