583	     * exactly 4 digits, and when the owner's region (derived from its city, {@link #regionForCity})
584	     * has a known postcode range in {@link #REGION_POSTCODES} the postcode must fall within that
585	     * inclusive range. A region with no known range ({@code 'UNKNOWN'}) accepts any 4-digit postcode.
